Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.09,0:00:24.47,Main,Gray,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.47,0:00:25.96,Main,Gray,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.96,0:00:28.17,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,These iceblades are merely emblems;
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.17,0:00:29.45,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,they are not my true nature.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.45,0:00:30.50,Main,Gray,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.50,0:00:34.38,Main,Gray,0,0,0,,Give your professor a \Nproper answer, Ray White!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.38,0:00:38.02,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,These are nothing more than symbols tied \Nto the name of the Iceblade Sorcerer.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.02,0:00:40.93,Main,Gray,0,0,0,,Make sense, damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.28,0:00:49.66,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,Deceleration.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.48,0:00:53.41,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,Lock registration!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.90,0:00:58.04,Main,Gray,0,0,0,,Why?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.04,0:01:00.40,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,Let's have a lesson, Professor Gray.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.85,0:01:04.63,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,What is the biggest difference \Nbetween fire and ice-based sorcery?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.63,0:01:07.27,Main,Gray,0,0,0,,What? I'm the professor.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.27,0:01:08.43,Main,Gray,0,0,0,,What a foolish query.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.43,0:01:11.41,Main,Gray,0,0,0,,The main difference between \Nfire and ice sorcery
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.41,0:01:15.22,Main,Gray,0,0,0,,is whether code is used to accelerate or \Ndecelerate the particles' vibrations.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.47,0:01:17.01,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,That's correct,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.01,0:01:18.10,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,I expected nothing less from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.65,0:01:22.13,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,In other words, ice sorcery \Nutilizes deceleration.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.66,0:01:25.97,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,Many sorcerers only execute that processing \Non a subconscious level.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.43,0:01:28.26,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,But I have created code so intricate
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.26,0:01:30.48,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,that I am able to control both \Ndeceleration and anchoring
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.48,0:01:34.07,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,with such precision that an average \Nperson could never emulate it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.35,0:01:36.94,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,Then, using antimaterial code,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.94,0:01:39.27,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,I am able to reverse the \Ncode theory itself,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.27,0:01:41.99,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,and revert all spells back to prima materia.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.30,0:01:43.23,Main,Gray,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.23,0:01:45.46,Main,Gray,0,0,0,,Antimaterial code?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.46,0:01:48.00,Main,Gray,0,0,0,,But no one's ever done that successfully!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.24,0:01:50.11,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,Don't you understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.11,0:01:53.74,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,Before me, all sorcery returns to the void.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.01,0:01:57.75,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,That is the true nature of the \Ncurrent Iceblade Sorcerer.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.75,0:02:00.31,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,Material shift, ice sword!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.65,0:02:09.20,Main,Gray,0,0,0,,Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.20,0:02:11.90,Main,Gray,0,0,0,,I even used the Dark Triad...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.90,0:02:15.15,Main,Gray,0,0,0,,This can't be happening!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.38,0:02:17.10,Main,Claris,0,0,0,,What kind of sorcery is that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.10,0:02:18.18,Main,Evi,0,0,0,,I don't know!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.18,0:02:19.76,Main,Amelia,0,0,0,,Could that be...?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.76,0:02:21.78,Main,Elisa,0,0,0,,Mind infiltration sorcery...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.23,0:02:35.84,Main,Evi,0,0,0,,Hey, doesn't Ray look odd?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.77,0:02:38.52,Main,Elisa,0,0,0,,His body...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.52,0:02:40.34,Main,Amelia,0,0,0,,It's getting covered in ice.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.40,0:02:54.11,Main,Gray,0,0,0,,You're not in control \Nof your power, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.76,0:02:59.71,Main,Gray,0,0,0,,I can do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.71,0:03:00.61,Main,Gray,0,0,0,,I can do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.98,0:03:03.33,Main,Gray,0,0,0,,Die, Iceblade!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.33,0:03:04.15,Main,Amelia,0,0,0,,Ray!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.25,0:03:11.78,Main,Gray,0,0,0,,Even if you are the Iceblade...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.13,0:03:15.71,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,Ice Bloom Profusion!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.38,0:03:30.35,Main,Gray,0,0,0,,No! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.81,0:03:34.04,Main,Albert,0,0,0,,Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.39,0:03:43.93,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,Professor Gray, let's have \Nyou rest there for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.90,0:03:51.38,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,Deceleration.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.55,0:03:56.71,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,Chronos Lock, activate.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.85,0:03:58.79,Main,Amelia,0,0,0,,Ray!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.79,0:04:00.61,Main,Evi,0,0,0,,Ray!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.67,0:04:04.33,Italics,Ray,0,0,0,,I protected them.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.04,0:04:06.59,Italics,Ray,0,0,0,,Nobody was lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.41,0:04:11.84,Italics,Ray,0,0,0,,So it's fine now, right, Master?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.52,0:04:18.98,Sign_Basic,Title,0,0,0,,{\fad(475,1)\an8\fnTimes New Roman\b1\shad0\3c&HB25813&\blur3}T{\3c&HB3571A&}h{\3c&HB35621&}e{\3c&HB45529&} {\3c&HB45430&}I{\3c&HB55337&}c{\3c&HB5513E&}e{\3c&HB65045&}b{\3c&HB64F4C&}l{\3c&HB74E54&}a{\3c&HB74D5B&}d{\3c&HB84C62&}e {\fnArial\b1\shad0\3c&HFFFFFF&\blur3\c&HB3571A&}S{\c&HB54F25&}o{\c&HB8482F&}r{\c&HBA403A&}c{\c&HBD3944&}e{\c&HBF314F&}r{\c&HC22A59&}e{\c&HC42264&}r\N{\fnGeorgia\b0\c&H000000&}Shall {\fnArial\b1\shad0\3c&HFFFFFF&\blur3\c&HB3571A&}R{\c&HB94533&}u{\c&HBE344B&}l{\c&HC42264&}e {\fnGeorgia\b0\c&H000000&}the {\fnTimes New Roman\b1\shad0\3c&HB25813&\blur3\c&HFFFFFF&}W{\3c&HB65428&}o{\3c&HB94F3C&}r{\3c&HBD4B51&}l{\3c&HC04665&}d
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.52,0:04:18.98,ep title,Titl,0,0,0,,{\fad(475,0)\3c&H576784&\an2}Episode 5\N{\fscx70}The Boy Who Became the World's Strongest Sorcerer Has an Unexpected Meeting on the Battlefield
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.61,0:04:22.28,Flashback,Lydia,0,0,0,,Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.76,0:04:23.99,Flashback,Lydia,0,0,0,,Hey, hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.26,0:04:28.40,Flashback,Lydia,0,0,0,,Hang on! I'll save you!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.85,0:04:37.13,Flashback,Abbie,0,0,0,,Lydia, who's that kid?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.13,0:04:39.95,Flashback,Carol,0,0,0,,When did you become a mom, Lydia?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.95,0:04:42.00,Flashback,Lydia,0,0,0,,Why do you go there, Dumbpink?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.00,0:04:43.67,Flashback,Lydia,0,0,0,,I'm still...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.67,0:04:46.80,Flashback,Carol,0,0,0,,Still what, I wonder?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.53,0:04:51.80,Flashback,Carol,0,0,0,,Colonel! Lydia's...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.22,0:04:57.81,Flashback,Henrik,0,0,0,,Ainsworth, could you please let \Nus know what's going on here?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.81,0:05:00.76,Flashback,Lydia,0,0,0,,I heard a voice crying out to me,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.76,0:05:04.05,Flashback,Lydia,0,0,0,,so I searched the area and found this child.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.40,0:05:06.90,Flashback,Lydia,0,0,0,,It looks like he's the only survivor.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.85,0:05:10.07,Flashback,Lydia,0,0,0,,What?! They're refusing to take him in?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.07,0:05:12.58,Flashback,Lydia,0,0,0,,He's a war orphan from this country!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.58,0:05:16.04,Flashback,Abbie,0,0,0,,It seems like the village \Nhe's from is special.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.04,0:05:17.34,Flashback,Lydia,0,0,0,,What does that mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.34,0:05:20.46,Flashback,Abbie,0,0,0,,It's a completely independent \Ndomain inside the country.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.75,0:05:23.59,Flashback,Abbie,0,0,0,,Apparently, the government's stance \Nis complete non-intervention.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.59,0:05:27.00,Flashback,Lydia,0,0,0,,So they're saying that \Nchild is not a citizen?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.00,0:05:28.22,Flashback,Lydia,0,0,0,,That's ridiculous!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.59,0:05:32.72,Flashback,Abbie,0,0,0,,That village is rumored to be cursed.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.33,0:05:34.47,Flashback,Lydia,0,0,0,,Cursed?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.76,0:05:37.57,Flashback,Abbie,0,0,0,,Something about performing rituals \Nto call gods into mediums and such.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.57,0:05:41.62,Flashback,Lydia,0,0,0,,Are people really still talking \Nabout curses and gods?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.93,0:05:46.90,Flashback,Abbie,0,0,0,,I mean ceremonies and religion\Nstill exist in the Kingdom, as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.90,0:05:48.79,Flashback,Lydia,0,0,0,,A dwindling few.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.12,0:05:51.02,Flashback,Abbie,0,0,0,,Since the code theory was discovered,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.02,0:05:55.53,Flashback,Abbie,0,0,0,,even magic was once considered\Nsupernatural before it became sorcery.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.53,0:05:57.72,Flashback,Abbie,0,0,0,,If the research continues at the current rate,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.72,0:06:00.45,Flashback,Abbie,0,0,0,,we might even uncover the \Ntrue meaning of the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.84,0:06:05.63,Flashback,Abbie,0,0,0,,But for people to go on living, \Nsome things need to be hidden, as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.02,0:06:08.71,Flashback,Lydia,0,0,0,,I won't deny there are \Npsychological benefits.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.71,0:06:09.70,Flashback,Abbie,0,0,0,,Oh, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.70,0:06:10.63,Flashback,Lydia,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.63,0:06:13.14,Flashback,Abbie,0,0,0,,I hear he's regained consciousness.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.14,0:06:15.07,Flashback,Lydia,0,0,0,,Why didn't you say that first, you idiot?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.32,0:06:21.01,Flashback,Carol,0,0,0,,And what's your name?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.47,0:06:24.28,Flashback,Lydia,0,0,0,,Carol!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.62,0:06:25.72,Flashback,Carol,0,0,0,,Lydia.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.72,0:06:26.84,Flashback,Lydia,0,0,0,,What's his status?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.84,0:06:29.44,Flashback,Carol,0,0,0,,He's stable, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.84,0:06:31.39,Flashback,Lydia,0,0,0,,What's your name?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.43,0:06:34.85,Flashback,Lydia,0,0,0,,It's no use.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.86,0:06:36.76,Flashback,Young Ray,0,0,0,,Ray.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.30,0:06:38.82,Flashback,Lydia,0,0,0,,So your name is Ray?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.36,0:06:40.26,Flashback,Young Ray,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.37,0:06:43.03,Flashback,Lydia,0,0,0,,My name is Lydia.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.03,0:06:44.79,Flashback,Lydia,0,0,0,,Lydia Ainsworth.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.67,0:06:47.04,Flashback,Young Ray,0,0,0,,Lydia...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.09,0:06:50.35,Flashback,Lydia,0,0,0,,Let's play ball!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.35,0:06:51.08,Flashback,Lydia,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.39,0:06:53.34,Flashback,Lydia,0,0,0,,Carol, what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.39,0:06:57.34,Flashback,Carol,0,0,0,,Becoming great friends \Nwith Ray, that's what!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.34,0:06:59.75,Flashback,Carol,0,0,0,,Today, I've been reading him picture books.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.75,0:07:03.26,Flashback,Carol,0,0,0,,Ray, can you say my name?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.87,0:07:04.89,Flashback,Young Ray,0,0,0,,Carol.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.89,0:07:09.23,Flashback,Carol,0,0,0,,But I told you, you can call me Carocaro!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.23,0:07:11.87,Flashback,Carol,0,0,0,,Now, why don't you try saying, \N"I love you, Carocaro"?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.26,0:07:13.37,Flashback,Young Ray,0,0,0,,Carol.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.39,0:07:20.12,Flashback,Lydia,0,0,0,,Ray, it seems you already know how \Nthis Dumbpink should be treated.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.87,0:07:25.87,Flashback,Carol,0,0,0,,It's not funny, Lydia!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.87,0:07:26.65,Flashback,Carol,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.75,0:07:31.49,Flashback,Carol,0,0,0,,He laughed just now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.49,0:07:32.65,Flashback,Carol,0,0,0,,He laughed, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.65,0:07:35.37,Flashback,Lydia,0,0,0,,It seemed like that, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.39,0:07:40.92,Flashback,Lydia,0,0,0,,Hey, Ray, I'll tell you about \Nmy legendary acts of bravery!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.92,0:07:42.30,Flashback,Carol,0,0,0,,Not that again!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.30,0:07:43.86,Flashback,Lydia,0,0,0,,Shut up, Dumbpink.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.86,0:07:45.37,Flashback,Carol,0,0,0,,Pffff!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.14,0:07:51.26,Flashback,Abbie,0,0,0,,Lydia, about Ray....
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.26,0:07:53.22,Flashback,Lydia,0,0,0,,Have you found anywhere we could leave him?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.22,0:07:54.15,Flashback,Abbie,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.14,0:07:57.34,Flashback,Lydia,0,0,0,,What should I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.65,0:08:02.20,Flashback,Abbie,0,0,0,,You're not thinking of taking him yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.20,0:08:03.05,Flashback,Lydia,0,0,0,,Of course not.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.39,0:08:05.57,Flashback,Lydia,0,0,0,,We're soldiers.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.57,0:08:07.70,Flashback,Lydia,0,0,0,,Of course I wasn't considering that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.55,0:08:12.06,Flashback,Lydia,0,0,0,,But I don't know what that \NDumbpink will say.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.06,0:08:13.59,Flashback,Carol,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.59,0:08:15.55,Flashback,Carol,0,0,0,,Ray is staying with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.64,0:08:19.67,Flashback,Henrik,0,0,0,,Oh, boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.67,0:08:22.61,Flashback,Flore,0,0,0,,Caroline, you understand that's\Nimpossible, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.61,0:08:23.91,Flashback,Carol,0,0,0,,It is possible!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.91,0:08:26.72,Flashback,Carol,0,0,0,,I have money! I could feed him!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.72,0:08:28.88,Flashback,Flore,0,0,0,,We have a mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.88,0:08:30.97,Flashback,Carol,0,0,0,,Then I'll take him to my own house,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.97,0:08:33.57,Flashback,Carol,0,0,0,,but I'm not abandoning him!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.40,0:08:37.92,Flashback,Howard,0,0,0,,I do understand where Carol's coming from,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.92,0:08:39.07,Flashback,Derek,0,0,0,,but there's nothing—
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.07,0:08:40.77,Flashback,Carol,0,0,0,,That's not true!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.77,0:08:42.42,Flashback,Both,0,0,0,,We're sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.42,0:08:44.10,Flashback,Henrik,0,0,0,,And what about you two?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.10,0:08:45.67,Flashback,Abbie,0,0,0,,As you say, Colonel,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.67,0:08:48.75,Flashback,Abbie,0,0,0,,I believe he should be given to an \Norphanage or adopted by someone.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.52,0:08:51.26,Flashback,Henrik,0,0,0,,And you, Ainsworth?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.48,0:08:57.57,Flashback,Lydia,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.09,0:08:59.92,Flashback,Lydia,0,0,0,,Ray.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.77,0:09:09.13,Flashback,Lydia,0,0,0,,Ray, what do you want to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.70,0:09:12.97,Flashback,Lydia,0,0,0,,You heard us talking, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.00,0:09:21.00,Flashback,Young Ray,0,0,0,,I want to stay with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.58,0:09:39.58,Flashback,Lydia,0,0,0,,Colonel.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.04,0:09:41.15,Flashback,Henrik,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.46,0:09:45.67,Flashback,Lydia,0,0,0,,My family, specifically \Nmy elder sister's family,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.67,0:09:48.20,Flashback,Lydia,0,0,0,,has a daughter close to Ray's age.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.20,0:09:50.15,Flashback,Lydia,0,0,0,,Carol and Abbie will help, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.17,0:09:53.14,Flashback,Lydia,0,0,0,,I will take responsibility for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.43,0:09:57.19,Flashback,Henrik,0,0,0,,Is there something about Ray that's \Nprompted you to go such lengths?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.64,0:10:02.11,Flashback,Lydia,0,0,0,,There is, which is exactly why I \Nbelieve he needs proper guidance.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.45,0:10:04.55,Flashback,Henrik,0,0,0,,I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.55,0:10:07.36,Flashback,Henrik,0,0,0,,So long as this does not affect your \Nduties, you have my permission.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.26,0:10:11.45,Flashback,Carol,0,0,0,,Oh, thank goodness!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.45,0:10:14.60,Flashback,Carol,0,0,0,,Ray, you're going to stay with us forever!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.14,0:10:15.92,Flashback,Lydia,0,0,0,,Ray,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.84,0:10:19.21,Flashback,Lydia,0,0,0,,from now on you'll be staying with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.21,0:10:21.70,Flashback,Lydia,0,0,0,,No, with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.20,0:10:23.42,Flashback,Young Ray,0,0,0,,Together?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.42,0:10:24.13,Flashback,Lydia,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.75,0:10:26.72,Flashback,Young Ray,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.03,0:10:30.77,Flashback,Lydia,0,0,0,,Which means that from \Nnow on, I'm your master.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.77,0:10:32.12,Flashback,Young Ray,0,0,0,,Master?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.12,0:10:35.25,Flashback,Lydia,0,0,0,,That's right! You are my apprentice!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.25,0:10:38.49,Flashback,Lydia,0,0,0,,I will be teaching you everything I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.01,0:10:41.95,Flashback,Young Ray,0,0,0,,Okay! Got it, Master!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.12,0:10:46.20,Sign_Basic,Text,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,450)\shad0\fnTimes New Roman\bord1\b1\fs20\pos(320,300)}Six Years Later\N Far East War\N Front Inside the Republic of Merth
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.68,0:10:48.05,Flashback,Man,0,0,0,,Captain, we're done for!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.05,0:10:50.25,Flashback,Captain,0,0,0,,Everyone, retreat!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.29,0:11:03.90,Flashback,Young Ray,0,0,0,,Icicle Blades!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.16,0:11:11.72,Flashback,Howard,0,0,0,,Complete annihilation confirmed.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.72,0:11:13.16,Flashback,Howard,0,0,0,,Impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.16,0:11:16.61,Flashback,Derek,0,0,0,,All right, then. We'll let the \Nsoldiers take over after this.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.61,0:11:19.61,Flashback,Young Ray,0,0,0,,Right, they're waiting for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.78,0:11:24.12,Flashback,Guy,0,0,0,,That was a kid, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.77,0:11:29.12,Flashback,Guy2,0,0,0,,So those are the Arnold Kingdom army's Astrals?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.52,0:11:30.88,Flashback,Flore,0,0,0,,This is Correine.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.88,0:11:32.26,Flashback,Flore,0,0,0,,Subjugation complete.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.26,0:11:33.25,Flashback,Flore,0,0,0,,We're heading back.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.53,0:11:35.32,Flashback,Abbie,0,0,0,,Overheating.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.32,0:11:37.02,Flashback,Abbie,0,0,0,,What an awful sight.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.02,0:11:39.11,Flashback,Lydia,0,0,0,,Excessive use of sorcery,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.11,0:11:42.18,Flashback,Lydia,0,0,0,,the stress from being in an environment \Nwhere death is omnipresent...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.64,0:11:46.87,Flashback,Lydia,0,0,0,,It's like battlefields were \Ndesigned to cause overheating.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.95,0:11:51.20,Flashback,Flore,0,0,0,,Rampant power that you \Ncan't control.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.20,0:11:53.82,Flashback,Flore,0,0,0,,The only thing that follows is \Nthe destruction of your mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.21,0:11:57.11,Flashback,Flore,0,0,0,,A disease veritably caused \Nby modern sorcery.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.11,0:11:58.17,Flashback,Lydia,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.17,0:12:02.70,Flashback,Lydia,0,0,0,,It can happen to any sorcerer \Non the battlefield.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.10,0:12:05.41,Flashback,Lydia,0,0,0,,To anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.60,0:12:10.50,Flashback,Henrik,0,0,0,,So, this is the situation at the moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.50,0:12:14.70,Flashback,Henrik,0,0,0,,The sorcerers Konpeki and Raimei \Nhave both been confirmed dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.70,0:12:16.24,Flashback,Carol,0,0,0,,Of the Seven Grands?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.24,0:12:17.96,Flashback,Derek,0,0,0,,So there's someone powerful \Nenough to do that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.96,0:12:23.47,Flashback,Abbie,0,0,0,,I suppose that means it's certain that the \NAywell Empire is intervening in this war.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.47,0:12:27.54,Flashback,Henrik,0,0,0,,From here on, the battle lines \Nwill only get more fierce.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.54,0:12:31.43,Flashback,Henrik,0,0,0,,Even us Astrals may not get away unscathed.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.43,0:12:34.37,Flashback,Henrik,0,0,0,,I want you all to redouble your focus.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.96,0:12:37.84,Flashback,Flore,0,0,0,,Ray, you are still young.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.84,0:12:39.78,Flashback,Flore,0,0,0,,You could still go back, if you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.22,0:12:41.77,Flashback,Young Ray,0,0,0,,Captain Correine...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.77,0:12:45.16,Flashback,Derek,0,0,0,,That's right. You're the same age as my son.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.16,0:12:47.82,Flashback,Derek,0,0,0,,That's not an age to be on the battlefield.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.62,0:12:53.78,Flashback,Young Ray,0,0,0,,My master taught me that people \Nwith talent have a responsibility.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.78,0:12:56.89,Flashback,Young Ray,0,0,0,,I consider this unit to be like a family...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.89,0:13:00.07,Flashback,Young Ray,0,0,0,,No, you are my family.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.54,0:13:03.29,Flashback,Young Ray,0,0,0,,Commander Henrick, Captain Correine.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.29,0:13:04.88,Flashback,Young Ray,0,0,0,,Colonel Garnet.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.88,0:13:06.68,Flashback,Young Ray,0,0,0,,Derek, Howard.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.68,0:13:07.64,Flashback,Young Ray,0,0,0,,Master.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.64,0:13:09.24,Flashback,Young Ray,0,0,0,,And Carol, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.24,0:13:10.32,Flashback,Carol,0,0,0,,Ray!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.59,0:13:12.86,Flashback,Young Ray,0,0,0,,I've prepared for this \Never since I enlisted.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.66,0:13:18.28,Flashback,Howard,0,0,0,,If anything happens to \Nyou, I'll come save ya!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.28,0:13:19.48,Flashback,Young Ray,0,0,0,,Howard...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.39,0:13:24.74,Flashback,Young Ray,0,0,0,,Howard!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.46,0:13:29.53,Flashback,Young Ray,0,0,0,,Howard!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.04,0:13:35.58,Flashback,Lydia,0,0,0,,Ray, don't!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.84,0:13:42.08,Flashback,Young Ray,0,0,0,,Howard!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.10,0:13:45.81,Flashback,Howard,0,0,0,,Ray, you go and live.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.31,0:13:51.40,Flashback,Howard,0,0,0,,For now, I'll go up into this \Nwide sky and watch you grow.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.40,0:13:53.46,Flashback,Young Ray,0,0,0,,No, Howard!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.46,0:13:56.10,Flashback,Howard,0,0,0,,Live, Ray.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.18,0:14:05.06,Main,Lydia,0,0,0,,Ray, are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.07,0:14:09.11,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,Master...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.34,0:14:12.72,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.72,0:14:14.13,Main,Lydia,0,0,0,,Looks like you used it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.97,0:14:16.82,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,I'm very sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.82,0:14:18.03,Main,Lydia,0,0,0,,Don't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.03,0:14:20.12,Main,Lydia,0,0,0,,I would have done the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.46,0:14:22.03,Main,Lydia,0,0,0,,Don't worry about it too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.03,0:14:24.72,Main,Lydia,0,0,0,,In the end, it all went well.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.72,0:14:27.76,Main,Lydia,0,0,0,,At some point, you'll no longer \Nneed the Chronos Lock.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.13,0:14:30.73,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,That reminds me! Everyone...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.73,0:14:32.22,Main,Abbie,0,0,0,,Is fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.22,0:14:35.03,Main,Abbie,0,0,0,,It seems they only suffered from a \Nslight magical energy deficiency.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.03,0:14:36.99,Main,Abbie,0,0,0,,Everyone's already recovered.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.33,0:14:39.11,Main,Abbie,0,0,0,,You did well, Ray.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.86,0:14:53.22,Main,Lydia,0,0,0,,Anyway, I'm glad that you're okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.77,0:14:56.49,Main,Lydia,0,0,0,,Come visit me again when \Nyou've got some time.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.49,0:14:58.33,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,Yes, Master.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.33,0:14:59.00,Main,Lydia,0,0,0,,Yup.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.24,0:15:06.27,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,Miss Carla?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.01,0:15:08.27,Main,Carla,0,0,0,,Your ear, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.79,0:15:12.14,Main,Carla,0,0,0,,Miss Lydia was very worried about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.08,0:15:15.77,Main,Carla,0,0,0,,Please get some rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.17,0:15:17.30,Main,Carla,0,0,0,,Good bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.50,0:15:26.58,Main,Abbie,0,0,0,,I was against it, at first.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.58,0:15:27.15,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.61,0:15:29.65,Main,Abbie,0,0,0,,Against you attending the school.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.76,0:15:34.15,Main,Abbie,0,0,0,,I thought you needed more rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.61,0:15:37.46,Main,Abbie,0,0,0,,Even among the other sorcery \Nacademies in our country,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.46,0:15:40.00,Main,Abbie,0,0,0,,ours is especially full of people \Npreoccupied with bloodlines.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.41,0:15:43.17,Main,Abbie,0,0,0,,An ordinary like yourself \Nwould only be unhappy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.64,0:15:46.86,Main,Abbie,0,0,0,,Raised on the battlefield, \Ntouched by so many deaths.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.86,0:15:49.68,Main,Abbie,0,0,0,,After all you've been through,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.05,0:15:54.46,Main,Abbie,0,0,0,,I couldn't stand the thought of \Nputting you into an environment
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.46,0:15:56.68,Main,Abbie,0,0,0,,full of the discrimination from the nobles.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.00,0:15:58.29,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,Miss Abbie...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.74,0:16:02.09,Main,Abbie,0,0,0,,But then Lydia came and bowed her head.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.09,0:16:03.18,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,My master did?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.55,0:16:07.93,Main,Abbie,0,0,0,,Her and I go way back, but this was \Nthe first time she's ever done that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.63,0:16:13.20,Flashback,Lydia,0,0,0,,Ray is even stronger and kinder \Nthan we ever imagined.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.77,0:16:17.57,Flashback,Lydia,0,0,0,,That's why I want him to know \Nthat there's more to this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.48,0:16:20.78,Flashback,Lydia,0,0,0,,The good and the bad...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.78,0:16:25.10,Flashback,Lydia,0,0,0,,I want him to learn how to feel, \Nhow to think, and how to live.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.57,0:16:29.62,Flashback,Lydia,0,0,0,,What Ray needs now is not us adults,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.62,0:16:31.54,Flashback,Lydia,0,0,0,,and especially not the battlefield.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.51,0:16:36.43,Flashback,Lydia,0,0,0,,He needs everyday experiences \Nappropriate for a boy his age.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.93,0:16:40.60,Flashback,Lydia,0,0,0,,Ray doesn't have friends his own age.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.28,0:16:46.49,Flashback,Lydia,0,0,0,,I mean, I had you, and I guess Carol.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.58,0:16:50.25,Flashback,Abbie,0,0,0,,So that's you want him here?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.71,0:16:53.85,Flashback,Lydia,0,0,0,,He...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.82,0:16:57.33,Flashback,Lydia,0,0,0,,He deserves to find happiness.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.41,0:16:59.31,Flashback,Abbie,0,0,0,,Lydia...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.07,0:17:02.59,Flashback,Lydia,0,0,0,,Abbie, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.81,0:17:06.15,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,Master...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.64,0:17:20.67,Main,Lydia,0,0,0,,I'm so glad Ray is okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.67,0:17:22.89,Main,Carla,0,0,0,,I'm glad, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.90,0:17:33.73,Main,Abbie,0,0,0,,Ray, enjoy your life at school.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.27,0:17:36.50,Main,Abbie,0,0,0,,Find your own happiness.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.50,0:17:37.90,Main,Abbie,0,0,0,,That is our wish for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.68,0:17:40.37,Main,Abbie,0,0,0,,And Lydia's.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.23,0:17:44.01,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.21,0:17:50.35,Main,Abbie,0,0,0,,Go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.91,0:17:54.37,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,You came to visit me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.66,0:17:55.43,Main,Amelia,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.94,0:17:58.77,Main,Evi,0,0,0,,Are you... all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.77,0:17:59.88,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.88,0:18:02.37,Main,Evi,0,0,0,,I see. I'm glad.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.46,0:18:04.91,Main,Amelia,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.91,0:18:05.76,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.15,0:18:08.77,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,I kept my secret from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.06,0:18:12.10,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,I am one of the seven grand sorcerers,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.10,0:18:13.94,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,the Iceblade Sorcerer.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.19,0:18:17.17,Main,Amelia,0,0,0,,I... see.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.93,0:18:21.49,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,Having fought alongside my master \Nand the others in the Far East War,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.07,0:18:25.23,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,I overheated in the final battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.61,0:18:27.25,Main,Claris,0,0,0,,Overheated?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.51,0:18:30.27,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,It's when you lose control of your engram.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.27,0:18:33.53,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,I myself don't entirely understand \Nwhat exactly happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.28,0:18:35.87,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,But when I regained consciousness,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.87,0:18:38.05,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,I saw that everything around \Nme had become a wasteland.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.48,0:18:41.55,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,My bleeding master had her arms around me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.46,0:18:48.16,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,Even now, I am using a spell called \NChronos Lock to keep from overheating.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.56,0:18:51.87,Main,Amelia,0,0,0,,So is this maybe the reason \Nyou're not so good at sorcery?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.87,0:18:54.16,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,That's correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.76,0:18:58.10,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,I lost many precious friends in battle
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.48,0:19:01.11,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,and I caused my master grievous injuries.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.38,0:19:05.37,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,Of course, even though they were our enemies, \NI took countless numbers of their lives, as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.70,0:19:10.29,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,I hid my blood-soaked \Npast and I deceived you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.29,0:19:11.36,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,I am...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.08,0:19:14.24,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,My hands are stained with blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.12,0:19:18.38,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,Do I have the right to be near you at all?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.65,0:19:21.43,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,I've been thinking about it the entire time.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.51,0:19:23.89,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,I am truly sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.30,0:19:35.31,Main,Amelia,0,0,0,,I want you to be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.31,0:19:36.52,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,Amelia...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.52,0:19:39.19,Main,Amelia,0,0,0,,No matter what happened in your past,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.19,0:19:41.63,Main,Amelia,0,0,0,,I believe in the person you are right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.02,0:19:44.71,Main,Amelia,0,0,0,,I know that you are an \Nextremely kind person.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.71,0:19:46.10,Main,Evi,0,0,0,,That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.10,0:19:49.35,Main,Evi,0,0,0,,You're an amazing person and my best bud!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.35,0:19:52.27,Main,Evi,0,0,0,,And that's not going to change, \Nno matter what happened in your past.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.27,0:19:55.27,Main,Elisa,0,0,0,,I'll always be with you, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.27,0:19:57.13,Main,Elisa,0,0,0,,I mean, you're my friend!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.13,0:19:58.07,Main,Claris,0,0,0,,Jeez.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.07,0:20:00.94,Main,Claris,0,0,0,,I can't believe you spent \Ntime worrying about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.94,0:20:02.70,Main,Claris,0,0,0,,W-We're friends!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.70,0:20:03.26,Main,Amelia,0,0,0,,Ray!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.87,0:20:06.83,Main,Amelia,0,0,0,,We all want to stay with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.83,0:20:09.56,Main,Amelia,0,0,0,,You're not alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.45,0:20:20.78,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,Thank you, all.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.51,0:20:34.58,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,Good evening,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.65,0:20:37.12,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,Mr. Alium.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.74,0:20:39.67,Main,Albert,0,0,0,,Ray White.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.28,0:20:42.32,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,What are you doing here at this hour?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.69,0:20:46.24,Main,Albert,0,0,0,,I needed to apologize.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.11,0:20:50.90,Main,Albert,0,0,0,,I've done things that can \Nnever be taken back.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.40,0:20:53.13,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,I accept your apology.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.13,0:20:54.49,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,It's water under the bridge.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.49,0:20:56.44,Main,Albert,0,0,0,,But that's...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.44,0:21:00.21,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,You acknowledged your shortcomings \Nand delivered an honest apology.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.21,0:21:02.43,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,I think that alone is truly amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.11,0:21:05.44,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,You really felt that remorse \Ndeep in your heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.75,0:21:07.87,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,That's why you're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.36,0:21:10.45,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,Or am I wrong, Albert?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.32,0:21:13.37,Main,Albert,0,0,0,,White...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.81,0:21:14.82,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,You can call me Ray.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.82,0:21:16.24,Main,Albert,0,0,0,,But...!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.48,0:21:18.90,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,That's what I'd like you to call me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.64,0:21:23.49,Main,Albert,0,0,0,,I just can't win.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.49,0:21:27.06,Main,Albert,0,0,0,,How can you be so strong and \Nnever stray from your path?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.33,0:21:28.31,Main,Albert,0,0,0,,Ray...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.31,0:21:34.83,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,Bloodlines or talent, having those things \Nfrom birth is a wonderful thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.27,0:21:36.59,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,But that's not everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.25,0:21:40.11,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,Effort and the right \Nenvironment are necessary, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.72,0:21:43.15,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,All I did was end up in a good environment,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.15,0:21:45.84,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,then simply live day by day.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.27,0:21:50.54,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,Shake off your doubts and \Ntake a new look at yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.87,0:21:53.42,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,By now you understand, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.03,0:21:58.22,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,Once we are aware, \Nwe can start anything over.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.22,0:22:02.05,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,You're the only one who can provide \Nyourself with the answer you seek.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.37,0:22:09.31,Main,Albert,0,0,0,,What I needed in my life \Nwasn't to hate people,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.31,0:22:10.58,Main,Albert,0,0,0,,it was to accept people...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.27,0:22:19.68,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,You're going to become much \Nstronger after this, Albert.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.16,0:22:22.79,Main,Albert,0,0,0,,Thank you, Ray.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.71,0:22:27.51,Main,Abbie,0,0,0,,One of our staff members has \Nleft us for personal reasons,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.51,0:22:31.34,Main,Abbie,0,0,0,,so let me introduce you to the new teacher \Nwho will be replacing Helena Grady.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.34,0:22:34.24,Main,Carol,0,0,0,,Why hello there, everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.84,0:22:38.83,Main,Carol,0,0,0,,That is right, I will be \Nyour homeroom teacher!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.30,0:22:41.77,Main,Carol,0,0,0,,My name is Carol Caroline!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.77,0:22:47.98,Main,Carol,0,0,0,,Feel free to call me Caro, \Nor Carocaro, or Miss Carolin.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.98,0:22:48.96,Main,Carol,0,0,0,,Teehee!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.46,0:22:53.96,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,S-Say what?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.96,0:22:58.45,Main,Carol,0,0,0,,Looking forward to working with you all!
