Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.28,0:23:51.92,Main,Lydia,0,0,0,,Listen, this is the preview \Nof the next episode of
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.92,0:23:54.18,Main,Lydia,0,0,0,,{\i1}The Iceblade Sorcerer Shall Rule the World{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.00,0:23:56.94,Main,Lydia,0,0,0,,With the upcoming tournament to \Ndetermine the strongest student,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.94,0:23:58.29,Main,Lydia,0,0,0,,Amelia is quite harsh on herself.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.29,0:24:00.53,Main,Lydia,0,0,0,,Is the one who appears before \Nher as she struggles against
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.53,0:24:02.62,Main,Lydia,0,0,0,,her preordained fate a devil or an angel?!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.62,0:24:06.45,Main,Lydia,0,0,0,,"The Boy Who Became the World's \NStrongest Sorcerer Dons a Mask".
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.50,0:24:10.00,ep title,txt,0,0,0,,Episode 6\N{\fscx90}The Boy Who Became the World's Strongest Sorcerer Dons a Mask
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.87,0:24:09.10,Main,Lydia,0,0,0,,This was Lydia Ainsworth!
